        },
        {
          "text": "“Guchinsikö chiyö hano ömöntö aarëbhateebhia iga, ‘Tamaaha Masihi ngö gönö hano!’ gösë iga, ‘Ngögööra haara!’ mötagaacha gukukumia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kugira bhariirichokera Masihi abhö öbhörongo na abhanaabhi bha öbhörongo; nabho mbarëkora ibhimanyiirriö ibhinene na ibhirögööro korri bhang'aine ninyoora na abhaahöroa bhië Ënooköë ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono bhainyu muiraarërre, kugira mbateebhiri mbere amang'ana gayö gataraabha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.13.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
